WEBVTT

1
00:00:38.706 --> 00:00:44.812
What's up, everybody,
and welcome to the very
last episode of our vlog.

2
00:00:44.845 --> 00:00:48.316
We have Sarah, Hannah,
Hannah's driving.
Say hello, Hannah.

3
00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:51.352
Hello, Hannah.
We started this a long time ago.

4
00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.122
We basically just wanted to help
people who couldn't find it
for themselves.

5
00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:56.757
But this is our last entry.

6
00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.727
That's very true.
That is because
I am leaving the country

7
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.495
to do some traveling
at the end of the month,

8
00:01:01.529 --> 00:01:05.733
and Hannah is joining
the United States Marine Corps.

9
00:01:05.766 --> 00:01:07.701
But that does not mean
we can lose focus.

10
00:01:07.735 --> 00:01:09.770
We are on a mission,
we have a goal.

11
00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:11.605
We're losing our minds
in this car.

12
00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:15.176
It's been a long ride,
been asking a lot of
personal questions.

13
00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:19.447
What you heard in a previous
installment was a letter
from a man named Mark.

14
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.750
Now, Mark, he comes
from Hope County, Montana.

15
00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:24.185
That's where we are right now.

16
00:01:24.218 --> 00:01:27.688
All the beautiful, well,
cows and everything.

17
00:01:27.721 --> 00:01:29.490
It's actually very pretty.

18
00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:31.859
But he is accusing
a group called Eden's Gate,

19
00:01:31.892 --> 00:01:36.597
of taking control of his town
and taking people
against their will.

20
00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:37.631
Doesn't sound legal.

21
00:01:38.232 --> 00:01:39.400
It's true.

22
00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:41.335
A number of people have gone
missing in Hope County recently,

23
00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:44.638
but that does not mean
that Eden's Gate
is abducting people.

24
00:01:44.672 --> 00:01:47.475
It doesn't mean
they're not abducting people.

25
00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:49.643
Either way,
I think there's
a lot more to this story.

26
00:01:49.677 --> 00:01:52.313
Police have told them that
there's nothing to investigate.

27
00:01:52.346 --> 00:01:53.381
That's where we come in.

28
00:01:53.414 --> 00:01:56.384
That's where we come in.

29
00:01:56.417 --> 00:01:58.419
We're on our way to see Mark,

30
00:01:58.452 --> 00:02:01.689
and we're gonna go try to see
if we can find the evidence
that he's looking for.

31
00:02:01.722 --> 00:02:04.758
And if we do, you guys
will be the first to know.

32
00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:06.460
All right,
stick around, subscribe,

33
00:02:06.494 --> 00:02:09.597
and we will upload footage
as we shoot it. Bye.

34
00:02:13.401 --> 00:02:14.602
Cool.
Nice one.

35
00:02:39.293 --> 00:02:40.894
ALEX: It's good.

36
00:02:40.928 --> 00:02:42.863
Good, right?
They're into local brewery
called Whistling Beaver.

37
00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:48.202
They started serving it a while
back before everything changed.

38
00:02:48.236 --> 00:02:52.373
All right, so, you made
a lot of accusations about
this group, Eden's Gate.

39
00:02:52.406 --> 00:02:57.545
All true.
They've been taking people,
including my sister Lenny.

40
00:02:57.578 --> 00:03:02.716
Are you saying Eden's Gate
kidnapped your sister
and the police did shit?

41
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:06.320
Well, she left on
her own accord.

42
00:03:06.354 --> 00:03:10.691
But she's been spending
all sorts of time with this
man named John Seed.

43
00:03:10.724 --> 00:03:12.560
The Seed family run the Peggies.

44
00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:14.428
ALEX: The Peggies?

45
00:03:14.462 --> 00:03:18.332
MARK:
Hey, that's what we call 'em.
The Project Eden's Gate. P-E-G.

46
00:03:18.366 --> 00:03:21.235
One day, she comes home,
packs her bags and takes off.

47
00:03:21.269 --> 00:03:25.839
I called her,
finally get her on the phone,
she was not acting herself.

48
00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:31.912
Kept talking about some
man named Joseph, the one
I told you about? Father.

49
00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:34.615
Is it possible
she just got religion?

50
00:03:34.648 --> 00:03:37.518
I know my sister, okay?

51
00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:42.022
But when I talk
to her on the phone,
zero energy, zero life.

52
00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:44.292
It was just zapped out of her.

53
00:03:44.325 --> 00:03:46.594
Question is, what do they want?

54
00:03:46.627 --> 00:03:49.297
MARK: They're saying that
the world is coming to an end.

55
00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:53.667
They're preparing for it.
For the end of time.
Do you believe that?

56
00:04:02.643 --> 00:04:05.546
ALEX: Good. Yeah.
Okay.

57
00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:08.816
Joseph Seed is giving
his sermon, at the Tala Ranch.

58
00:04:08.849 --> 00:04:11.652
We're gonna go check it out.
See if can get a closer look
at Eden's Gate.

59
00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.289
Perfect. We're good.

60
00:04:15.323 --> 00:04:17.525
Is the light on?
Do you see the light?
No.

61
00:04:17.558 --> 00:04:19.360
ALEX: Not bad.
How does it look?
No, looks good.

62
00:04:19.393 --> 00:04:20.428
Are you guys ready?

63
00:04:20.461 --> 00:04:21.562
Mm-hmm.
SARAH: Yeah.

64
00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:25.032
Then let's do this.

65
00:04:36.944 --> 00:04:39.347
JOHN: You are here
because you are scared.

66
00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.817
Scared because of what
you see on the news,
and what you hear on the radio.

67
00:04:43.851 --> 00:04:47.788
Deception. Divisiveness.
Godlessness.

68
00:04:48.889 --> 00:04:50.290
Who's in charge?

69
00:04:51.091 --> 00:04:53.494
Who is accountable?

70
00:04:55.496 --> 00:04:57.831
But there is an answer
to that fear.

71
00:05:00.668 --> 00:05:02.370
And that answer has a name.

72
00:05:04.938 --> 00:05:06.340
And that name...

73
00:05:08.075 --> 00:05:10.444
is Joseph Seed!

74
00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:37.571
JOSEPH:
Thank you, my brother John.

75
00:05:41.642 --> 00:05:44.378
I want you to all
close your eyes for a moment.

76
00:05:45.846 --> 00:05:49.583
And I want you to think about
the world outside this tent.

77
00:05:52.152 --> 00:05:55.155
And as you sit there alone
in your personal darkness,

78
00:05:55.188 --> 00:06:01.562
can you see how sick
our society has become?

79
00:06:01.595 --> 00:06:05.533
Can you picture disease
creepin' across the land?

80
00:06:07.435 --> 00:06:11.672
Greed. War. Starvation.

81
00:06:13.441 --> 00:06:15.643
Because people have
turned away from God.

82
00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:19.146
And there is a hatred brewin'.

83
00:06:20.981 --> 00:06:25.986
It's like a slow-acting poising
churning in our guts.

84
00:06:26.019 --> 00:06:31.992
So I ask you, when you think
of that world, do you feel safe?

85
00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.094
ALL: No.

86
00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:35.896
JOSEPH: No.

87
00:06:35.929 --> 00:06:38.699
That's her, that's Lenny.

88
00:06:38.732 --> 00:06:43.671
If somethin' is comin',
you can feel it, can't you?

89
00:06:43.704 --> 00:06:47.775
You wake up in the morning,
you turn on that television,
you look at those news headlines

90
00:06:47.808 --> 00:06:50.844
and it's all fear
and confusion and anger.

91
00:06:54.014 --> 00:06:57.417
JOSEPH: See, we're like
frightened animals,
just creepin' toward the edge.

92
00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:00.087
And there will be a reckoning.

93
00:07:01.722 --> 00:07:04.892
And it is painful.

94
00:07:04.925 --> 00:07:08.696
I look right into your hearts
and I see how much
pain you have,

95
00:07:08.729 --> 00:07:13.767
because the world out there
cuts you so deep.

96
00:07:13.801 --> 00:07:18.138
But I'm here to tell you
the suffering...
well, that's a choice.

97
00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:22.075
And you can choose
a better path.

98
00:07:24.144 --> 00:07:27.948
We love you. We want you.

99
00:07:27.981 --> 00:07:31.018
We accept you exactly
the way you are.

100
00:07:31.051 --> 00:07:36.890
Every single one of you,
and I stand here
asking you to join us,

101
00:07:38.225 --> 00:07:41.495
and you will find
your peace with us.

102
00:07:43.096 --> 00:07:47.535
I am your Father,
and you are my children.

103
00:07:49.136 --> 00:07:54.241
And together,
we will march to Eden's Gate.

104
00:08:01.081 --> 00:08:02.082
Hell yeah!

105
00:08:11.992 --> 00:08:13.694
That is not who she is.

106
00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:19.933
She obviously loves him, Mark.
There's somethin' about him.

107
00:08:19.967 --> 00:08:21.001
No, I can get her out of here.

108
00:08:21.034 --> 00:08:22.202
HANNAH:
Hey! Hey! Hey!

109
00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:25.005
Relax.

110
00:08:25.038 --> 00:08:27.240
I do believe you,
that something
is going on, okay?

111
00:08:27.274 --> 00:08:29.309
I saw my sister,
that's what's going on.

112
00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:33.280
I know. We wanna help you.
That's what we do, remember?
That's why you called us.

113
00:08:33.313 --> 00:08:37.017
Look, it's none of my business,
but confronting her in a place
like this, is just not...

114
00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.052
It's not the way.

115
00:08:39.086 --> 00:08:41.622
I just wanna know what's
happening to my sister.
What's happening to my home.

116
00:08:41.655 --> 00:08:45.058
HANNAH: And the way to find that
out is to expose them,
but we have to do it quietly.

117
00:08:46.326 --> 00:08:47.628
Can you trust us?

118
00:08:49.697 --> 00:08:50.698
Okay.

119
00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:15.889
Okay. Okay.
Uh, so we just tailed, uh,

120
00:09:15.923 --> 00:09:18.926
Mark's sister about,
uh, 15 miles.

121
00:09:18.959 --> 00:09:24.231
We're outside of the revival
and now, we are trailing them
on foot through this,

122
00:09:24.998 --> 00:09:26.667
um, forest.

123
00:09:30.037 --> 00:09:32.139
Well, it's uh,
getting a little strange.

124
00:09:35.843 --> 00:09:37.044
LENNY: Stop!

125
00:09:37.077 --> 00:09:41.114
JOSEPH: The road
to atonement is buried
in sacrifice and pain.

126
00:09:41.148 --> 00:09:46.820
Admit to your sins, sister!
Etch it into your blood
and I will take it from you.

127
00:09:46.854 --> 00:09:47.888
ALEX: Shit.

128
00:09:47.921 --> 00:09:49.957
JOSEPH: You will drown
in his presence!

129
00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:57.631
You will drown in his presence,
and when you rise,
you will be worthy of atonement.

130
00:09:57.665 --> 00:10:01.101
We must wash away our past.
We must expose our sins.

131
00:10:01.134 --> 00:10:02.169
What did they just do to her?

132
00:10:02.202 --> 00:10:04.171
It's gotta be some kinda drug.

133
00:10:04.204 --> 00:10:08.275
I knew it. I fuckin' knew it.
Anyone who ever said
yes to these bastards.

134
00:10:08.308 --> 00:10:12.045
JOSEPH:
...stand in the light of God,
and walk through his gates...

135
00:10:12.079 --> 00:10:14.214
JACOB: Hello there, Mr. Pink.

136
00:10:14.247 --> 00:10:17.184
ALEX:
Oh, shit. Okay. Okay, okay.

137
00:10:17.217 --> 00:10:18.251
HANNAH: Okay.

138
00:10:18.819 --> 00:10:20.053
Oh, God.

139
00:10:20.087 --> 00:10:21.121
ALEX: Oh, shit.

140
00:10:23.757 --> 00:10:25.192
What are y'all doin' here, huh?

141
00:10:27.427 --> 00:10:29.229
JOSEPH:
The road to atonement...

142
00:10:30.831 --> 00:10:32.299
You are shocked
by what you see?

143
00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:36.036
God is shocked by what
has happened to his world.

144
00:10:36.069 --> 00:10:37.337
MARK:
What are you doing?

145
00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.906
JOSEPH:
It's full of hate and sin.

146
00:10:38.939 --> 00:10:40.107
We're gonna be a family again.

147
00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.308
MARK:
What

148
00:10:41.341 --> 00:10:42.342
Stop it!

149
00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.912
No, please, stop!

150
00:10:44.945 --> 00:10:46.279
We're not gonna say shit!

151
00:10:52.285 --> 00:10:55.856
SARAH: What are you doing?
What are you pouring in there?
What is that?

152
00:10:55.889 --> 00:10:57.290
Something to help you see.

153
00:11:00.928 --> 00:11:03.797
God's will must be kept secret.

154
00:11:03.831 --> 00:11:05.398
To threaten that is a sin.

155
00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.268
Now you must atone!

156
00:11:08.301 --> 00:11:09.369
SARAH: No!
HANNAH: No!

157
00:11:15.142 --> 00:11:16.710
Welcome to Eden's Gate.

158
00:11:24.985 --> 00:11:29.056
JOSEPH:
Can you see now, son?

159
00:11:29.089 --> 00:11:34.795
Can you see the lies that have
stolen your sight?
See the bliss?

160
00:11:34.828 --> 00:11:38.799
It is a serum that
shows you the truth.

161
00:11:38.832 --> 00:11:42.435
Because you'll be lost in
the glow of your screens,

162
00:11:42.469 --> 00:11:47.474
the false highs of consumerism,
indifferent to the suffering
of all the souls around you.

163
00:11:49.877 --> 00:11:53.246
But I will grasp your sin
through your hand

164
00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.816
and I will tear it
from your bones.

165
00:11:57.985 --> 00:12:02.089
And I will return you to
the angels you once were.

166
00:12:02.122 --> 00:12:04.157
Your greed has made us blind.

167
00:12:09.863 --> 00:12:10.898
SARAH: Alex!

168
00:12:10.931 --> 00:12:11.965
ALEX: No!

169
00:12:11.999 --> 00:12:13.333
SARAH: Alex! No! Alex!

170
00:12:15.869 --> 00:12:17.737
JOSEPH: God has told me
what will come.

171
00:12:19.172 --> 00:12:21.374
Like Noah built his arc,

172
00:12:21.408 --> 00:12:24.511
I will build bunkers
to survive the collapse.

173
00:12:26.579 --> 00:12:29.449
And after God's wrath
has blown through...

174
00:12:32.152 --> 00:12:35.555
angels will once more
walk the earth.

175
00:12:58.445 --> 00:13:01.014
ALL: Father.

176
00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.185
WOMAN: Father.

177
00:13:11.324 --> 00:13:13.560
You see, men will resist,

178
00:13:13.593 --> 00:13:16.496
so we need to prepare
for the fight. Yeah?

179
00:13:19.299 --> 00:13:22.535
Sister Faith
will help us. Hmm.

180
00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:31.879
It's such a pleasure
to meet all of you.

181
00:14:33.206 --> 00:14:34.607
Where are my friends?

182
00:14:35.508 --> 00:14:37.344
Safe.

183
00:14:40.113 --> 00:14:41.915
You are all safe now.

184
00:14:43.516 --> 00:14:45.252
You're safe from sin.

185
00:14:46.486 --> 00:14:48.922
Safe from the collapse.

186
00:14:48.956 --> 00:14:53.093
You see, every moment,
we move closer to our fate.

187
00:14:55.295 --> 00:15:01.201
And here you are.
You're delivered to me.

188
00:15:01.234 --> 00:15:06.473
Now, you and your friends are
gonna have to discover where
you belong in this new world.

189
00:15:06.506 --> 00:15:11.711
I'm gonna send each of you
with one of my heralds.
They'll guide you.

190
00:15:11.744 --> 00:15:16.283
My brother John, Jacob,
my sister Faith.

191
00:15:18.351 --> 00:15:20.253
You will not be alone.

192
00:15:20.287 --> 00:15:23.590
I'm not alone anymore.
I found people that I love.

193
00:15:25.758 --> 00:15:28.161
They've moved on now,
haven't they?

194
00:15:29.762 --> 00:15:32.099
I can see that truth
in your eyes.

195
00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:37.971
Where's Sarah?

196
00:15:39.239 --> 00:15:40.240
I don't know.

197
00:15:48.648 --> 00:15:50.417
MARK: You guys
have anything on this?

198
00:15:59.159 --> 00:16:04.097
ALEX: Hey. Hey!
My minicam is still working.

199
00:16:04.131 --> 00:16:07.667
We can upload more footage
if we can get to a phone
or a computer.

200
00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.636
MARK: You can do that?

201
00:16:09.669 --> 00:16:11.738
ALEX: Yeah, the raw footage
automatically uploads
to the cloud,

202
00:16:11.771 --> 00:16:14.207
and then all we have to do
is transfer it to the website.

203
00:16:14.241 --> 00:16:17.510
Well, we're all tied up
and who knows how deep
into the mountains.

204
00:16:17.544 --> 00:16:18.678
There's no getting out of here.

205
00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.750
She's right.
We're deep out, man.

206
00:16:25.618 --> 00:16:29.356
What the hell are you guys
talking about?
We're just giving up?

207
00:16:31.691 --> 00:16:38.031
All right, look, we've been
captured, almost drowned,
drugged, we're tied up.

208
00:16:38.065 --> 00:16:39.632
Who knows what the hell
they're doing to Sarah?

209
00:16:39.666 --> 00:16:41.368
We don't know what
they have planned.

210
00:16:41.401 --> 00:16:42.669
ALEX: We gotta get outta here.

211
00:16:45.605 --> 00:16:47.074
SARAH:
What am I doing here?

212
00:16:49.476 --> 00:16:54.013
Well, when I saw you outside,
it was your eyes.

213
00:16:55.582 --> 00:16:57.550
So full of sadness.

214
00:17:00.387 --> 00:17:04.291
We know what it's like
to be alone.

215
00:17:09.829 --> 00:17:14.367
You are so special,
it shines right off you.

216
00:17:31.418 --> 00:17:33.253
MARK: Hey. Oh, man.

217
00:17:35.822 --> 00:17:37.090
ALEX: Okay.

218
00:17:39.859 --> 00:17:42.061
I remember when I was...

219
00:17:43.596 --> 00:17:45.732
first put into one of
those group homes.

220
00:17:47.234 --> 00:17:49.602
I often had such
a difficult time breathing.

221
00:17:51.404 --> 00:17:52.705
Like you were drowning?

222
00:17:54.774 --> 00:17:55.775
Yes.

223
00:17:59.179 --> 00:18:03.150
Like I was drowning.
They took me away
from my brothers.

224
00:18:05.418 --> 00:18:10.457
I was preyed upon.
I was abused.

225
00:18:11.524 --> 00:18:13.092
I'm not ashamed
to admit that now.

226
00:18:14.594 --> 00:18:19.699
And then one morning I awoke
and he was everywhere.

227
00:18:21.734 --> 00:18:27.774
God's voice,
and it was a terror
to conquer all others.

228
00:18:27.807 --> 00:18:33.112
And He was within me.
He chose me.

229
00:18:34.881 --> 00:18:36.683
He gave me his truth.

230
00:18:38.951 --> 00:18:40.520
What did you do?

231
00:18:42.289 --> 00:18:44.491
I listened to Him, Sarah.

232
00:18:59.372 --> 00:19:01.341
MARK: Guys.

233
00:19:01.374 --> 00:19:04.211
HANNAH: Come on.
Give me, come on.

234
00:19:10.383 --> 00:19:11.651
Listen to me.
Yeah.

235
00:19:11.684 --> 00:19:13.152
I may have an idea.

236
00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.222
Okay.

237
00:19:15.255 --> 00:19:20.360
But there is a way forward.
Will you let me
show you the way?

238
00:19:31.571 --> 00:19:34.241
Hello! Hello!

239
00:19:36.676 --> 00:19:37.844
Hey!

240
00:19:39.246 --> 00:19:40.547
Holy shit.

241
00:20:03.436 --> 00:20:04.471
Hey, you okay?

242
00:20:04.504 --> 00:20:06.473
MARK: Yeah.
Thanks, man. Yeah.

243
00:20:10.477 --> 00:20:14.714
ALEX: What the fuckin' hell,
guys. It was close.

244
00:20:16.549 --> 00:20:18.985
There's no signal.
I fuckin' hate this place.

245
00:20:19.018 --> 00:20:23.923
Sarah, I swear to God
that I will never abandon you.

246
00:20:25.658 --> 00:20:26.659
Ever.

247
00:20:36.503 --> 00:20:38.438
You're home now, Sarah.

248
00:20:58.391 --> 00:21:00.026
MAN: I'm out.
See you up there.

249
00:21:09.836 --> 00:21:12.539
ALEX: We should go.
The sun's coming up.

250
00:21:23.516 --> 00:21:24.851
MARK: Okay.

251
00:21:46.739 --> 00:21:47.874
You're home.

252
00:22:05.992 --> 00:22:07.860
MARK:
What about your friend?

253
00:22:07.894 --> 00:22:08.995
We're gonna
still help her out.

254
00:22:09.028 --> 00:22:11.464
All we do, is we upload
the footage from the minicam

255
00:22:11.498 --> 00:22:13.065
and then we just bring
in the motherfuckin' cavalry.

256
00:22:13.099 --> 00:22:15.067
No, no.
We do the cops first,
and then the footage.

257
00:22:15.101 --> 00:22:16.102
Okay.

258
00:22:23.476 --> 00:22:24.577
HANNAH:
You okay?

259
00:22:47.066 --> 00:22:50.970
This is the time.
This is the end.

260
00:22:59.211 --> 00:23:01.147
John? Jacob!

261
00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:06.586
HANNAH:
Come on, Alex. Shit!

262
00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:10.423
MAN 1: Go, go, go!

263
00:23:10.457 --> 00:23:11.458
MAN 2: Get down!

264
00:23:14.561 --> 00:23:17.063
MAN 1:
Come on, move! Go, go, go!

265
00:23:20.066 --> 00:23:21.133
MAN 2: Move!

266
00:23:49.161 --> 00:23:51.498
Hello

267
00:23:51.531 --> 00:23:53.566
Yes! Yes. Me and my friends
are captured.

268
00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:56.836
We're on the run at northeast
Hope County in the White Trails.

269
00:23:56.869 --> 00:23:58.705
We're headin' to
the Veteran Center.
Can you meet us?

270
00:24:01.574 --> 00:24:03.776
We gotta upload the footage.
The cops are hours out.

271
00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:05.945
Those fuckers are everywhere.
Come on, gotta go.

272
00:24:05.978 --> 00:24:07.113
Alex, let's go!

273
00:24:53.259 --> 00:24:55.528
I want you to flank
them to the right.

274
00:24:55.562 --> 00:24:57.196
I want you to flank
them to the left.

275
00:24:59.566 --> 00:25:03.836
Jacob, bring my children home.

276
00:25:11.978 --> 00:25:13.813
HANNAH: Just go.
I'll hold them off
as long as I can.

277
00:25:14.581 --> 00:25:15.615
MARK: Take it!

278
00:25:15.648 --> 00:25:18.117
Alex, listen to me.
This is the only chance we have.

279
00:25:18.150 --> 00:25:21.187
You have to go. Go! Go, Alex!

280
00:25:28.661 --> 00:25:29.729
I'm out.

281
00:25:51.083 --> 00:25:53.886
HANNAH: You wanna meet God?
Now's your chance.

282
00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.788
Lower the steel, little sheep.

283
00:26:04.363 --> 00:26:08.334
If you're watching this,
then you already know
what's happening.

284
00:26:08.367 --> 00:26:12.204
Eden's Gate is here.
Hope County, Montana.

285
00:26:19.912 --> 00:26:20.913
Fuck!

286
00:26:25.718 --> 00:26:26.853
Surrender, brother.

287
00:26:29.155 --> 00:26:30.690
Surrender to God's will.

288
00:26:38.230 --> 00:26:43.169
JACOB: Death is upon
the world already.
Let us not fight any longer.

289
00:26:43.202 --> 00:26:47.373
Well, the fight's coming,
whether you like it or not.

290
00:27:06.859 --> 00:27:08.294
Do not fear, my son.

291
00:27:10.930 --> 00:27:15.702
You will be cleansed
of your sins,
and you will join me in Eden.

292
00:27:30.149 --> 00:27:34.086
ALEX: If you're watching this,
you already know
what's happening.

293
00:27:34.120 --> 00:27:36.856
Eden's Gate is here.
They're real.

294
00:27:36.889 --> 00:27:39.091
I don't know what
they're trying to do.

295
00:27:39.125 --> 00:27:42.361
They're taking people,
they have Lenny,
they have Sarah.

296
00:27:44.363 --> 00:27:47.233
Not very sure what's
going to happen to us,
but please, please...

297
00:27:47.266 --> 00:27:54.273
Come.
Come stop them please.
